{"source_line": 63, "text": "Feel like it have been become my tradition to ask for anime recommendation around this time. Anime I watched every year have become abyssmal amount since Im more toward video game now. So i think i might i need help from other for recommendation. Ignore my anime scoring, just share anime that you can suggest to newcomer for modern era (year 2020 and above) Preference : 1. just 1 cour, prefer ended the story in satisfied way (if cliffhanger, just hope got hyped final episode) 2. hopefully not episodic or monster of the week / problem solving, unless part of major arc 3. easy to get into as in plot get moving in first 3 episodes 4. got hyped moment once a while, not just slowburn (blame hyper brainrot content poisoned me now) 5. any genre is fine, as long as got interesting stuff 6. not a remake or readaptation from old source (doesnt have to be anime original) Probably there will be alot of popular stuff as well Which is fine as Im not up-to-date with any anime after 2020 mostly.", "entities": [{"start": 54, "end": 59, "label": "FORMAT", "text": "anime"}, {"start": 93, "end": 98, "label": "FORMAT", "text": "Anime"}, {"start": 257, "end": 262, "label": "FORMAT", "text": "anime"}, {"start": 283, "end": 288, "label": "FORMAT", "text": "anime"}, {"start": 313, "end": 321, "label": "ATTRIBUTE", "text": "newcomer"}, {"start": 326, "end": 336, "label": "ATTRIBUTE", "text": "modern era"}, {"start": 338, "end": 357, "label": "CONSTRAINT", "text": "year 2020 and above"}, {"start": 380, "end": 386, "label": "CONSTRAINT", "text": "1 cour"}, {"start": 493, "end": 505, "label": "CONSTRAINT", "text": "not episodic"}, {"start": 576, "end": 592, "label": "ATTRIBUTE", "text": "easy to get into"}, {"start": 599, "end": 603, "label": "ATTRIBUTE", "text": "plot"}, {"start": 642, "end": 654, "label": "ATTRIBUTE", "text": "hyped moment"}, {"start": 678, "end": 686, "label": "ATTRIBUTE", "text": "slowburn"}, {"start": 737, "end": 746, "label": "CONSTRAINT", "tex