{"source_line": 93, "text": "I'm looking for a comedic light novel that will (ideally) make me cry of laughter. I vividly remember reading through Konosuba and laughing until my throat hurt from the ridiculous scenarios and the hilarious decisions/reactions made by the characters. Ideally I'd like to read a series that is still being published/is completed and hasn't been abandoned. I don't want to read through a series only to have my heart crushed by the fact that I'll never get a taste of the ending! I'd appreciate any suggestions, Thank you!!!", "entities": [{"start": 18, "end": 37, "label": "ATTRIBUTE", "text": "comedic light novel"}, {"start": 118, "end": 126, "label": "TITLE", "text": "Konosuba"}, {"start": 280, "end": 286, "label": "FORMAT", "text": "series"}, {"start": 295, "end": 316, "label": "CONSTRAINT", "text": "still being published"}, {"start": 320, "end": 329, "label": "CONSTRAINT", "text": "completed"}, {"start": 388, "end": 394, "label": "FORMAT", "text": "series"}], "tokens": ["I'm", "looking", "for", "a", "comedic", "light", "novel", "that", "will", "(ideally)", "make", "me", "cry", "of", "laughter.", "I", "vividly", "remember", "reading", "through", "Konosuba", "and", "laughing", "until", "my", "throat", "hurt", "from", "the", "ridiculous", "scenarios", "and", "the", "hilarious", "decisions/reactions", "made", "by", "the", "characters.", "Ideally", "I'd", "like", "to", "read", "a", "series", "that", "is", "still", "being", "published/is", "completed", "and", "hasn't", "been", "abandoned.", "I", "don't", "want", "to", "read", "through", "a", "series", "only", "to", "have", "my", "heart", "crushed", "by", "the", "fact", "that", "I'll", "never", "get", "a", "taste", "of", "the", "ending!", "I'd", "appreciate", "any", "suggestions,", "Thank", "you!!!"], "bio_labels": ["O", "O", "O", "O", "B-ATTRIBUTE", "I-ATTRIBUTE", "I-ATTRIBUTE", "O", "O", "O", "O", "O", "O", "O", "O", "O", "O", "O", "O", "O", "B-TITLE", "O", "O", "O", "O", "O", "O", "O", "O", "O