{"source_line": 144, "text": "Are there any anime from the past decade that focus on military operations? If it's older than that I probably know it already. Doesn't have to be the military specific, could be para-military, the police or even a fire-fighting squad. As long as there is a team coordinating with each other to do missions it's fine. But they have to follow orders from a commander. I'm not interested in the politics behind the operation, just the execution with a focus on the whole team including the commander. There needs to be a sense of realism, but it doesn't need to be fully realistic. There are only two anime I remember that have what I am looking for: 2002, Koukaku Kidoutai: Stand Alone Complex 2005, Full Metal Panic: The Second Raid And even these two examples also have a bunch of other stuff mixed in. Other anime that come close (only listing anime I liked and only one per franchise): 2000, Jin-Roh 2003, Gunslinger Girl 2006, Code Geass 2006, Utawarerumono 2007, Darker Than Black 2012, Jormungand 2013, Shingeki no Kyojin 2013, Buki yo Saraba 2013, Log Horizon (the parts where they take down dungeons) 2013, Zettai Karen Children: The Unlimited - Hyoubu Kyousuke 2015, Gate 2017, Youjo Senki", "entities": [{"start": 14, "end": 19, "label": "FORMAT", "text": "anime"}, {"start": 29, "end": 40, "label": "CONSTRAINT", "text": "past decade"}, {"start": 55, "end": 74, "label": "ATTRIBUTE", "text": "military operations"}, {"start": 198, "end": 204, "label": "ATTRIBUTE", "text": "police"}, {"start": 393, "end": 401, "label": "ATTRIBUTE", "text": "politics"}, {"start": 599, "end": 604, "label": "FORMAT", "text": "anime"}, {"start": 673, "end": 692, "label": "TITLE", "text": "Stand Alone Complex"}, {"start": 810, "end": 815, "label": "FORMAT", "text": "anime"}, {"start": 846, "end": 851, "label": "FORMAT", "text": "anime"}], "tokens": ["Are", "there", "any", "anime", "from", "the", "past", "decade", "that", "focus", "on", "military", "operations?", "If", "it